---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Button from "../components/ui/Button.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="e-Invoicing Spain - Facturae, Verifactu & PEPPOL" description="Invoice Ninja e-invoicing compliance for Spain. Support for Facturae, Verifactu, PEPPOL, and all major EU e-invoice standards." path="/e-invoicing-spain/">
  <Header slot="header" />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-50 to-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <nav class="mb-8 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-primary">Home</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <a href="/e-invoicing/" class="hover:text-primary">e-Invoicing</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <span class="text-gray-700">Spain</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-dark mb-4">e-Invoicing in Spain</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-4">Reside en la UE? Es hora de aprender sobre la facturacion electronica!</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8">Mandatory electronic invoicing in the EU is coming soon! With our PEPPOL integration, you can start sending and receiving electronic invoices immediately.</p>
      <Button href="https://app.invoicing.co/#/register" size="lg">Create a Free Account!</Button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Verifactu Highlight -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-primary/5">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-dark mb-4">Yes, Invoice Ninja offers Verifactu billing for Spain!</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-4">Invoice Ninja fully supports Verifactu compliance for Spanish businesses. Our platform generates Verifactu-compliant invoices that meet Spain's anti-fraud regulations, ensuring your business stays compliant with the latest requirements from the Agencia Tributaria.</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">All <strong>Enterprise Plan</strong> subscribers automatically receive <strong>250 e-invoicing credits, FREE!</strong></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What is e-Invoicing? -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-dark mb-6">What is e-Invoicing?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-4">Electronic invoicing adoption is expanding rapidly across jurisdictions worldwide. Instead of sending PDF invoices by email, e-invoicing uses structured data formats that can be automatically processed by accounting systems on both ends of a transaction.</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-4">Invoice Ninja supports the UBL (Universal Business Language) format and various electronic invoice standards, including Facturae for Spain. Our platform enables direct invoice delivery through the PEPPOL network, ensuring your invoices reach their recipients in a compliant, machine-readable format.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Facturae Focus -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-dark mb-6">Facturae & Verifactu for Spain</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-4">Facturae is Spain's mandatory electronic invoice format for public sector transactions and is increasingly adopted for private sector B2B invoicing. Invoice Ninja generates fully compliant Facturae invoices that meet Spanish regulatory requirements.</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-4">Verifactu is Spain's anti-fraud invoicing system mandated by the Agencia Tributaria. It requires invoicing software to generate tamper-proof invoices with a chain of custody that can be verified by tax authorities. Invoice Ninja's Verifactu integration ensures every invoice you create meets these strict requirements.</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">Invoice Ninja handles the technical complexity of both Facturae and Verifactu so you can focus on your business -- simply create your invoice and we generate the compliant output automatically.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PEPPOL Network -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-dark mb-6">The PEPPOL Network</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-4">Invoice Ninja has deployed a PEPPOL access point, enabling you to send and receive e-invoices across a vast international network.</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-4">PEPPOL is like working with a telecommunications provider. When you make a phone call, you just dial the number and your provider works with the recipient's provider to establish the connection. You don't need to worry about the technical details -- it just works.</p>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">PEPPOL functions as an extremely secure international network that allows your company to exchange critical business documents electronically with any registered participant -- currently hundreds of thousands of public and private companies across borders.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- All Supported Standards -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-dark mb-8">All Supported e-Invoice Standards</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-2">PEPPOL</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Universal, cross-industry and cross-border standard.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-2">ZUGFeRD / XRechnung</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Germany's electronic invoicing standard.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-2">Facturae</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Spain's mandatory electronic invoice format.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-2">FatturaPA</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Italy's electronic invoicing format via SDI.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-2">FACT1</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Romania's electronic invoicing standard.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-2">EN16931</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Generic EU electronic invoicing standard.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Getting Started -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-dark mb-6">Getting Started with e-Invoicing in Spain</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-4">Each jurisdiction requires specific mandatory fields for electronic invoice validation. For Spain, ensure your Invoice Ninja account has the following properly configured:</p>
      <ul class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-6 list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
        <li>NIF/CIF (Spanish tax identification number)</li>
        <li>VAT identification number</li>
        <li>Complete company address details</li>
        <li>Correct tax rates and categories for your line items</li>
        <li>Verifactu compliance settings enabled</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8">Our support team can help validate your account data to ensure successful Facturae and Verifactu invoice generation and delivery through the PEPPOL network.</p>
      <div class="text-center">
        <Button href="https://app.invoicing.co/#/register" size="lg">Create a Free Account!</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>
